OL,3,GNEWSASemenyo 'froze' after alleged
OL,4,Aracist abuse, court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FFootballer Antoine Semenyo "froze"
OL,7,Fafter he was allegedly racially abused
OL,8,Fby a Liverpool fan during a Premier
OL,9,FLeague match at Anfield, a court has
OL,10,Fheard.
OL,12,FThe Manchester City winger, who was
OL,13,Fplaying for Bournemouth at the time,
OL,14,Fwas preparing to take a throw-in when
OL,15,FMark Mogan, 47, allegedly shouted a
OL,16,Fracist insult at him on 15 August 2025.
OL,18,FProsecutors said Semenyo was "clearly
OL,19,Fhurt and upset" and reported the
OL,20,Fincident to referee Anthony Taylor when
OL,21,Fthe ball next went out of play.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
